OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-Muslim hate report figures
OL,4,A'alarming'
OL,5,
OL,6,FReports of anti-Muslim hate and
OL,7,Fprejudice in London in the first half
OL,8,Fof the year have surpassed the total
OL,9,Fannual count for 2023, according to an
OL,10,Forganisation monitoring the issue.
OL,12,FAnti-Muslim hate-monitoring group Tell
OL,13,FMama branded the statistics it had
OL,14,Fcollated "alarming", saying the annual
OL,15,Ftotal was more than six times higher in
OL,16,F2025 than in 2021.
OL,18,FIt said the data showed a "sustained
OL,19,Fescalation of anti-Muslim hate" and
OL,20,Fbehind each report was "a Londoner who
OL,21,Fwas made to feel unsafe simply because
OL,22,Fof their faith".
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
