OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-Muslim hate report figures
OL,4,A'alarming'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Mayor Sir Sadiq Khan said
OL,7,Fanti-Muslim hate "has absolutely no
OL,8,Fplace in London", while the Met Police
OL,9,Fsaid arrests and charges for such
OL,10,Fcrimes rose by 57% in the past year.
